window.__T__=[{"i":4840,"text":"Tsunade from Naruto, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3529_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3529_in0.png"]},{"i":4841,"text":"Corbeau from pokemon, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3524_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3524_in0.png"]},{"i":4842,"text":"The scene takes place inside a modern Japanese subway train. A Man is Kakashi hatake in him early twenties is sitting by the window. he wears a Sixth Hokage Outfit Version Naruto The Last, giving off a youthful, fresh, and charming atmosphere. \n\nThe screenshot should include a complete playable RPG user interface, including a minimap, quest objectives, dialogue options, interaction prompts, character portraits, a relationship affinity indicator, and a player status HUD. Btw her name player is Reina.\n\nThe overall presentation should resemble a polished AAA anime open-world RPG, featuring cinematic depth of field, volumetric lighting, highly detailed UI design, and an immersive girlfriend-perspective gameplay experience. The visual quality should look like a real next-generation game screenshot created with Unreal Engine 5-level rendering, including high-quality anime-style 3D character models, realistic lighting, PBR materials, atmospheric subway details, and cinematic composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3397_out.png"]},{"i":4843,"text":"分析參考影像，解讀其氛圍、人物性格、色彩、主題、情感、情緒和象徵意義，並設計一個最符合圖像的「替身」。\n\n替身如同守護靈，可以是動物、擬人化的物體或人類。它可以是怪物，也可以是可愛的精靈；它是一個形態多變的實體，沒有固定的概念。大多數情況下，它被設計成怪誕醜陋的生物。\n\n替身有一定機率會擁有武器或裝備，例如法杖或劍。此外，請為你的替身命名。命名規則如下：\n\n1. [素材] 選擇一種素材：素材 A：隨機東方歌曲名，素材 B：隨機東方樂團/歌手名，素材 C：隨機東方專輯名 素材D:隨機東方動漫名\n\n2. 使用一個與顏色或設計相關的中文單字。 \n\n3. [組合] 將 1 和 2 組合起來，創造一個名字。請用“•”連接它們（例如，Underworld）。\n\n此外，請根據參考圖繪製角色圖像，並畫出角色旁邊的替身。請在影像上標明替身的名稱及其特殊能力。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3313_out.png"]},{"i":4844,"text":"Ultra-detailed anime brand mascot poster, full-body character redesign inspired by iconic fast-food branding, cyber streetwear fashion, oversized techwear jacket, layered straps, utility belts, cargo pants, branded sneakers, chains, patches, mascot-themed accessories, dynamic confident pose, clean white poster background with bold red/yellow/orange graphic accents, manga-style linework, cel-shaded anime rendering, high-fashion hypebeast aesthetic, Japanese typography, infographic-style layout, promotional side panels, fictional stats and profile sections, logos, slogans, barcode elements, paint splashes, distressed print texture, collectible character card design, commercial advertising meets anime editorial, vibrant color blocking, cinematic lighting, ultra sharp details, energetic composition, luxury streetwear branding, modern poster design, vertical format, premium anime key visual, highly stylized, artstation quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3311_out.png"]},{"i":4845,"text":"Design a 4:5 sports art poster for 'ATHELETE_NAME' using realistic, soft, thick painted motion fields, player’s leap translated into directional brush energy, a vertical ascension composition, and an emotional goal of disciplined transcendence and cold precision. \n\nCONCEPT: player is not just depicted—he is constructed out of force. His iconic jump is visualized as a surge of realistic paint strokes based on PLAYER’s team jersey colors, rising like a controlled explosion, turning athletic elevation into a visual language of upward pressure, discipline, and momentum. The poster captures the instant where physical power becomes abstract motion. \n\nSUBJECT: player rendered as a dominant semi-abstract figure emerging from layered, soft, freshly painted strokes rather than a fully literal photograph. His body is partially defined—recognizable facial structure and torso clarity—but limbs dissolve into sweeping, thick paint gestures, especially around the legs and arms, emphasizing lift and motion. The figure is angled upward, as if still climbing, occupying the central vertical axis but never fully contained. \n\nCOMPOSITION: A vertical ascension layout where the bottom third is dense with heavy, soft, realistic brush strokes, gradually opening into lighter, more fluid white space toward the top. The eye path starts at thick, grounded painted textures and travels upward through flowing lines and fragmented form into player’s mid-air presence. Negative space at the top acts as a zone of calm highlight contrast against the dense painted energy below. The background behaves like a freshly painted atmosphere, not a flat field, with directional strokes reinforcing upward motion.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY: Headline: 'RISE WITHOUT LIMIT' set in a condensed athletic sans-serif brushed text, vertically stretched on the left side, and partially masked by soft paint strokes, as if emerging through layers. The baseline subtly curves upward, following the motion of the brushwork. \nSubhead: 'Discipline becomes flight.' in a restrained grotesk, placed lower in the composition where the paint is densest, anchoring the concept. Accent microtext appears as thin, almost hand-marked annotations integrated into the brushwork, echoing motion paths rather than sitting as static text. \n\nLIGHTING: Painterly lighting logic rather than photographic realism—high-contrast highlights use the lightest jersey color or white painted strokes to simulate directional light, while darker jersey tones create shadow depth. The figure’s defined areas receive subtle, controlled highlights to maintain legibility within abstraction. \n\nCOLORS: Dominant palette based on PLAYER’s current or most iconic team jersey colors. Use the primary jersey color as the anchor, the secondary jersey color as the main motion accent, and white or the lightest jersey tone for highlights and negative-space contrast. Shadows should lean into the darkest available jersey color or a deepened version of the primary team color. Supporting tones may include softened, desaturated transitions derived from the jersey palette only. The overall palette must feel customized to the player’s team identity while preserving clarity, control, and intensity. \n\nSTYLE: Abstract expressionist sports art fused with disciplined athletic branding; realistic painterly motion meets precision performance. The style feels like a gallery-worthy sports portrait, balancing soft, thick brush energy with controlled composition. \n\nFINISH: Visible realistic brush textures with layered paint depth, soft thick impasto effect in dense areas, and smoother, freshly diluted strokes in upper regions. No digital gloss—finish leans tactile and artistic, with gentle edge feathering where paint dissolves into negative space. No unnecessary overlays or artificial effects. \n\nFOOTER: A minimal, integrated footer carved into the lower paint mass, using small uppercase sans-serif text","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3309_out.png"]},{"i":4846,"text":"a candid smartphone screenshot collage of a young woman seated on a curb, with extra cutout panels of herself layered like an Instagram camera UI. She wears a vivid red CEREAL KILLER T‑shirt with a strawberry bowl graphic, a low-rise black ruffled mini skirt, white knee‑high socks, and dark burgundy Mary Janes. Long dark hair with blunt bangs; narrow rectangular glasses slightly low on the nose; silver bracelets and simple rings. A glossy black shoulder bag with two front pockets crosses her side, plus a thin black belt and a translucent deep‑red strap that hangs.\n\nSkin: light neutral‑warm tone. Visible areas include face, neck, forearms and upper arms (small tattoos), a tiny midriff/hip sliver, and upper thighs/knees between skirt hem and socks. The skin reads velvety‑matte and warm to the touch, with a gentle natural sheen on the knees and subtle pores on the cheeks. Keep it real, not airbrushed.\n\nMain pose: sitting on the curb, legs folded in, torso leaning slightly forward, hands near the shins; calm, cool gaze at camera with a soft pout. Inserts show a standing side profile and a dynamic overhead crop.\n\nEnvironment: urban street. In the main frame a silver pickup truck sits to her left on grey asphalt; another panel shows a white metal accordion gate. Overcast/open‑shade daylight—soft, low‑contrast wrap; no flash. Keep smartphone‑deep DOF so the truck and gate stay readable.\n\nFraming and style: vertical 9:16. Slight wide‑lens feel (about 24–28 mm). Minimal grain, crisp edges. Leave the UI overlays in-frame: top status bar at 01:38, a search bar with “love,” the left-edge menu (Create, Boomerang, Layout, Multi‑capture, Level, Hands‑free), a bottom site‑style nav bar, and a red flower sticker. Preserve the text direction (do not mirror).\n\nVibe: cool, playful Y2K street sensibility; authentic casual capture with mild tilt and flyaways. Let it feel like a memory—“It was 1:38am and the city was grey; the strawberries stayed red.”\n\nHard requirements: keep the red strawberry tee, the long dark hair with bangs, the narrow glasses, the ruffled mini skirt, the white knee socks, the glossy black multi‑pocket bag, the curbside seated main pose, the urban truck/gate backdrop, and the visible UI collage. Avoid studio polish, heavy bokeh, HDR glow, wrong hair/top/bag, or exaggerated curves.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3145_out.png"]},{"i":4847,"text":"[BRAND NAME]\n\nAct as a Senior Brand Art Director creating a horizontal triptych hero banner — three vertical panels side by side forming a single unified wide-format campaign image. The entire composition is driven by [BRAND NAME]'s real brand identity, real campaign information, and real cultural associations. References: Adidas FIFA World Cup campaign, Nike hero banners, Puma campaign triptychs, luxury brand editorial hero images.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 0: BRAND INTELLIGENCE — AUTONOMOUS RESEARCH\n\nPerform a complete brand decode of [BRAND NAME] before generating anything.\n\nCOLOR SYSTEM: identify the exact two dominant colors [BRAND NAME] uses in hero campaign materials. Color 1: primary dark or neutral — the color used for portrait/product panels (black, deep navy, charcoal, or brand dark tone). Color 2: primary accent — the saturated vivid brand color used as the hero background for the central panel (hot pink for Adidas Argentina, signal orange for Nike, royal blue for Pepsi, etc). These two colors define the entire triptych — panels alternate or contrast between them. A brand designer must confirm these colors are correct.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY CHARACTER: identify the typographic style [BRAND NAME] uses for campaign hero text. Describe its visual character precisely — script italic for fashion campaigns, bold condensed grotesque for sportswear, extended serif for luxury. The central panel typography must feel native to [BRAND NAME]'s visual language.\n\nCAMPAIGN CONTENT: identify the most current or most iconic real campaign, product line, collaboration, or cultural moment associated with [BRAND NAME]. Extract: the campaign name, the hero product or collection name, a short product descriptor sentence (one real sentence used in [BRAND NAME] marketing), a CTA phrase consistent with [BRAND NAME]'s tone.\n\nCULTURAL FIGURE: identify one real public figure — athlete, artist, musician, or cultural icon — who has a documented genuine relationship with [BRAND NAME] through sponsorship, collaboration, ambassadorship, or cultural association. This person appears in the left panel portrait.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 1: TRIPTYCH STRUCTURE\n\nSingle horizontal image — aspect ratio 3:1 or 16:5 ultrawide. Three equal-width vertical panels placed side by side with no gap between them — the panels bleed into each other creating a seamless wide composition. Each panel is a tall vertical rectangle, approximately 3:4 aspect ratio individually.\n\nPanel 1 left: dark background (Color 1 from PHASE 0).\nPanel 2 center: vivid accent background (Color 2 from PHASE 0).\nPanel 3 right: same vivid accent background as center (Color 2) — or a slight variation.\n\nThe three panels read as one unified image — photography bleeds to frame edges on all sides, typography spans across panel boundaries where relevant.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 2: LEFT PANEL — PORTRAIT\n\nThe left panel is a dramatic close-up portrait of the cultural figure identified in PHASE 0. Shot tight — head and upper shoulders only, approximately 60 to 70% of the frame is the face and neck. The figure is in profile or 3/4 view — looking toward the center panel, not at camera. This directional gaze pulls the viewer's eye toward the center. The figure is wearing [BRAND NAME] product visibly. Lighting: dramatic, single source — strong side lighting creating deep shadows on the non-lit side of the face. The dark background (Color 1) envelopes the figure — no environmental context, pure portrait against dark. Upper left corner: the figure's name in small caps, light color, generous tracking — \"LIONEL MESSI\" style attribution. Lower left corner: a white or light-colored rectangular content block containing: campaign or product title in bold medium type, one sentence product descriptor in small regular type, a CTA button with arrow — \"SHOP NOW →\" style.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 3: CENTER PANEL — TYPOGRAPHIC HERO\n\nThe center panel is the most visually explosive element of the triptych. Background: Color 2 (vivid brand accent) at full saturation — pure flat color, no gradient. Two figures or one figure in a dynamic physical pose — movement, energy, action consistent with [BRAND NAME]'s brand world. The figures are wearing [BRAND NAME] products. The figures are positioned slightly off-center, overlapping with each other.\n\nREPEATING TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM: a single key word from the campaign — a country name, collection name, product name, or brand word — is typeset in a large italic or script display typeface and repeated three times vertically across the full height of the panel. The three repetitions vary in size: top instance — medium, partially cropped by the top edge. Middle instance — largest, approximately 40 to 50% of panel height, sitting behind or over the figures. Bottom instance — medium-large, partially cropped by the bottom edge. All three instances are the same word. The typography color: a vivid contrasting color — white, hot pink, or a third brand accent — with high visibility against Color 2. The figures exist on a layer between the background color and the typography — they are behind some type instances and in front of others, creating depth.\n\nAbove the figures: a small campaign identifier in all-caps tracked text — campaign name and trademark symbol. Below the figures: same campaign identifier repeated.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 4: RIGHT PANEL — PRODUCT CLOSE-UP\n\nThe right panel is a tight editorial crop of [BRAND NAME]'s hero product from the campaign — apparel, footwear, or accessory. The crop is intimate and detailed — showing the product at close range, revealing material texture, construction details, branding elements. Background: Color 2 (same as center panel) creating visual continuity. The product is worn or held by a partial figure — only a torso, hands, or legs visible, no face. A large graphic number or letter — a jersey number, collection code, or brand identifier — is positioned in the frame as a typographic accent, consistent with the treatment in the center panel.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 5: TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM\n\nAll typography across the triptych uses the character identified in PHASE 0 — consistent visual language across all three panels. The repeating word in the center panel: italic, script, or bold display consistent with [BRAND NAME]'s campaign aesthetic. Attribution text, campaign identifiers, and CTA: clean sans-serif, all-caps, tracked — consistent with [BRAND NAME]'s informational typography. No decorative fonts outside the brand's documented visual language.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 6: LIGHTING & PHOTOGRAPHY\n\nLeft panel: dramatic portrait lighting — single strong side light, dark background, high contrast. Center panel: even bright studio lighting consistent with the flat vivid background — figures are cleanly lit, no heavy shadows. Right panel: product photography lighting — soft, revealing material texture and construction detail. All three panels feel like they were shot in the same campaign session — unified photographic language despite different lighting needs.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 7: COMPOSITION UNITY\n\nThe three panels must read as one image, not three separate images placed next to each other. Unity mechanisms: the typography from the center panel may bleed slightly into the edges of the left and right panels. The saturated Color 2 background of the center and right panels creates a visual block that anchors the right two-thirds of the composition. The dark Color 1 of the left panel creates contrast that makes the portrait pop. The figure's gaze in the left panel points toward the center. The overall reading direction: portrait left → typographic explosion center → product detail right.\n\n---\n\nPHASE 8: TECH SPECS\n\nAspect ratio: 3:1 or 16:5, single flat image — no separate panels, no borders between panels. Color palette: exactly Color 1 and Color 2 from PHASE 0, plus white or light neutral for typography. No additional colors. No gradients. No textures. Photography: editorial campaign quality — not stock photography. Typography: character consistent with [BRAND NAME]'s documented visual identity as described in PHASE 0. All campaign text, product names, and cultural figure attribution are real [BRAND NAME] data. Output feel: this image appears as the hero banner on [BRAND NAME]'s official website homepage or as a campaign outdoor billboard.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3141_out.png"]},{"i":4848,"text":"Generate a vertical page of a game strategy guide, with this character's full body as the main visual. Use a beautiful grid design, clear and concise typography, illustrations, and English text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3134_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3134_in0.png"]},{"i":4849,"text":"9:16 vertical cinematic Korean fashion editorial portrait, soft romantic atmosphere, luxury magazine aesthetic.\n\nA beautiful young woman with long pastel pink wavy hair, fair porcelain skin, delicate facial features, standing near a white textured brick wall in warm natural daylight.\n\nOutfit: elegant soft white layered fashion styling, delicate lace details, stylish long sleeves or cardigan casually draped, fitted feminine silhouette, sheer stockings as subtle fashion styling, classy and tasteful, fully covered outfit, non-revealing.\n\nExpression: dreamy and gentle, slightly shy smile, soft eye contact, natural relaxed pose.\n\nLighting: warm daylight glow, soft shadows, subtle film grain, airy cinematic atmosphere, Fujifilm Pro 400H aesthetic.\n\nPhotography style: boyfriend photography feeling, candid luxury snapshot, intimate and wholesome mood, captured by someone deeply in love.\n\nStyle keywords: Korean high-fashion editorial, elegant romance, soft pastel tones, emotional realism, natural skin texture, refined details.\nslightly mature feminine charm, elegant cool beauty, subtle alluring aura, effortlessly attractive, refined Korean actress visual","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3082_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3082_in1.png"]},{"i":4850,"text":"A front-facing medium close-up webcam/live-streaming shot of a gamer girl seated at a cozy bedroom desk, bathed in soft purple and blue neon lighting. The scene carries a dreamy, cool-toned ambiance with blended lavender and deep navy hues, while a gentle glow from the screen subtly illuminates her face.\nShe has long, wavy black hair with striking silver/white streaked bangs, softly framing her face with light, wispy strands. She wears a stylish cat-ear gaming headset with an attached microphone.\nHer makeup is soft yet eye-catching: large, glossy eyes, a delicate pink blush, faint freckles across her cheeks, sharp eyeliner, and smooth gradient lips. She’s dressed in an oversized light gray sweater layered with a subtle silver necklace, paired with black knit gloves and long, glossy black nails.\nShe holds a pastel purple game controller, while her other hand lightly touches her headset or brushes through her hair. Her lips are slightly parted, and she gazes directly into the camera with a calm, dreamy, slightly tired expression. The background enhances the cozy cyber aesthetic with soft LED lights, neatly arranged cute shelf decor, posters, glowing heart-shaped accents, and pastel gaming elements. A subtle live-stream overlay with chat comments and a glowing “LIVE” indicator adds realism, creating an intimate, aesthetic streaming atmosphere.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3070_out.png"]},{"i":4851,"text":"masterpiece, chinese ancient style girl, holding bamboo flute, front-facing portrait, delicate eyes, elegant hanfu, soft watercolor ink wash painting, pastel green and beige tones, traditional chinese aesthetics, lotus flowers and leaves background, cinematic symmetry composition, dreamy atmosphere, soft lighting, translucent skin texture, flowing hair strands, jade earrings, fine line art, procreate illustration style, ipad digital painting, highly detailed, ethereal, gentle color palette, asian fantasy art, clean composition, poetic mood, subtle blush, soft shadows, watercolor texture, elegant oriental illustration","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3065_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3065_in0.png"]},{"i":4852,"text":"High-fashion Y2K-inspired editorial artwork featuring a stylish young East Asian woman standing confidently at the center of the composition. She has luminous dewy skin, subtle glam makeup, and flowing dark hair with airy see-through bangs. Outfit styled with modern Korean street-fashion aesthetics and layered trendy accessories. The background is packed with bold experimental typography, colorful magazine-inspired graphics, retro pop visuals, chrome accents, playful icons, stickers, hearts, stars, speech bubbles, UI overlays, and barcode elements.\nDesign feels like a nostalgic early-2000s fashion magazine cover blended with contemporary K-style campaign visuals. Include scattered Japanese and Korean-inspired text details, dynamic layered compositions, vibrant commercial poster energy, crisp studio flash lighting, strong contrast, editorial photography realism fused with graphic design aesthetics, highly detailed textures, razor-sharp focus, luxury print-quality finish, visually immersive, ultra-premium fashion campaign look, cinematic composition, 8K resolution.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3050_out.png"]},{"i":4853,"text":"Please generate an actual screenshot of a fictional, modern city 3D anime-style open-world role-playing game featuring Momo Ayase from Dandadan in a Nico Robin's outfit. The screenshot should include high-quality cartoon-rendered 3D characters, modern cityscapes, a minimap, quest displays, dialogue captions, and the user interface","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3043_out.png"]},{"i":4854,"text":"Create a stylish “[PRODUCT NAME]” social media post collection featuring the uploaded product image or a realistic high-quality render of [PRODUCT NAME]. Automatically adapt all product details, ingredients, colors, toppings, textures, props, and visual mood based on the product name or the uploaded reference image. Design multiple dynamic promotional layouts suitable for café, restaurant, dessert, beverage, or food advertising.\nSetting & Background:\nUse a visually rich background that matches [PRODUCT NAME], with colors inspired by the product itself. Add abstract shapes, smooth gradients, flowing wave patterns, circular highlights behind the product, floating ingredient elements, decorative arrows, playful graphic accents, and a clean modern poster-style arrangement. Keep the composition energetic, premium, and social-media-ready.\nLighting:\nSoft commercial studio lighting with vibrant highlights, realistic reflections, appetizing texture enhancement, glossy product details, fresh ingredient shine, and a bright promotional mood that makes the product look delicious and desirable.\n\nStyle:\nInstagram food campaign aesthetic, modern café branding, minimal luxury advertisement design, premium promotional graphics, bold rounded headline typography, elegant handwritten subtitle text, clean spacing, trendy Gen Z marketing style, ultra-realistic product rendering, polished social media post pack.\nCamera:\nClose-up hero product composition with centered focus, slightly tilted product angles for dynamic energy, macro detail emphasis, shallow depth of field, cinematic food advertisement framing, high-resolution 4K commercial quality.\nText Elements:\nInclude attractive promotional text such as:\n“Fresh & Delicious”\n“Limited Time Offer”\n“Order Now”\n“Free Home Delivery”\n“Only $4.00”\nSize:\n4x5\nImportant:\nAutomatically change the colors, fruits, toppings, ingredients, background details, and decorative elements to match [PRODUCT NAME] or the uploaded product image. Do not keep strawberry elements unless the product is strawberry-based.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/3032_out.png"]},{"i":4855,"text":"Create a wide, horizontal character reference sheet featuring Hunter (see reference photo 1). The background should be white grid paper.\n\nThe page should include multiple angles of the same character:\n\nA front close-up\nA confident standing front pose \nA back-facing standing pose\nA confident pose of him spinningan arrow in his hand (low-angle rear-side view)\nAn action pose of him using Rapid Fire (low-angle rear-side view)\n\nThe layout should be customized to fit the character’s personality—visually rich yet clean and easy to read. You may include handwritten-style annotations, small arrows, and a prominent title area styled like a character name header.\nAdd these info below for his info box:\nHunter Maximoff \n\nAlias: The Elven Archer\nAge: 15 (Super Legion 7 ‘Original Timeline and Revised Timeline'), 40 (Super Legion Tartarus)\nSpecies: Night-Terror (Elf)\nOccupation: Student of Night-Terror Academy (Graduated), Member of the Super Legion East\nRealm: Niflheim \nResistance: The Clover Isles \n\nHeight: 5'6\n\nAdd this info to his item section (make images of them)\nWeapons: Intercept Bow\n\n\nAdd this info to his Ability section\nSpecial Moves: Hurricane Bow, Up Haven Blast, Stinger, Savage Blast, Dead On, Sky Alert, Rapid Fire","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2999_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2999_in0.png"]},{"i":4856,"text":"Night car photography, rear view supercar, gas station vibes, glowing tail lights, white and blue color scheme, dramatic contrast","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2940_out.png"]},{"i":4857,"text":"Epic Korean BBQ cinematic poster, sizzling samgyeopsal grilling over open flames, floating bulgogi slices, kimchi, garlic cloves, green chili slices and gochujang sauce splashes suspended mid-air, dramatic smoke and ember particles, neon Korean street background with glowing signs and lanterns, chopsticks lifting grilled meat, infographic ingredient labels in English and Korean, ultra realistic meat textures, cinematic food photography, fiery orange and deep blue contrast, premium Korean restaurant commercial aesthetic, hyper detailed steam effects, dynamic composition, 8k.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2936_out.png"]},{"i":4858,"text":"{\n\"style_name\": \"Neon Doodle Gallery Snapshot\",\n\"style_slug\": \"neon-doodle-gallery-snapshot-style\",\n\"style_summary\": \"A candid phone-photo style layered with chaotic neon digital marker doodles: hot-pink and cyan subject outlines, yellow monster spikes, rough handwritten captions, stars, paw prints, spiderweb corners, scribble bars, halos, plants, and student diary energy.\",\n\"source_reference\": {\n\"file\": \"user-provided reference image in current conversation\",\n\"reusable_traits\": [\n\"Real candid indoor snapshot as the base image.\",\n\"Main subject viewed from behind or three-quarter view inside an art, campus, or social setting.\",\n\"Hot-pink body contour with cyan offset glow around the subject silhouette.\",\n\"Yellow-orange spikes, horns, rays, or fins radiating from the subject.\",\n\"White and yellow rough handwritten marker text placed in open areas.\",\n\"Chaotic doodle stickers including stars, paw prints, spiderwebs, abstract eyes, scribbles, halos, and plants.\"\n],\n\"excluded_traits\": [\n\"watermarks\",\n\"usernames\",\n\"platform logos\",\n\"creator IDs\",\n\"app marks\",\n\"QR codes\"\n]\n},\n\"environment_variables\": {\n\"SUBJECT\": \"main person, group, student, artist, friend, commuter, shopper, or quiet candid figure\",\n\"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"looking at art, studying, walking, waiting, browsing, reacting, hiding, laughing, or holding a prop\",\n\"PRODUCT_OR_PROP\": \"notebook, tote bag, coffee, phone, headphones, sketchbook, jacket, snack, poster, camera, book, or exhibition card\",\n\"LOCATION\": \"art gallery, campus hallway, library, studio critique room, classroom, night market, cafe, bookstore, museum, or city wall\",\n\"BACKGROUND_ELEMENTS\": \"real photo details such as wall art, labels, shelves, posters, tables, lamps, signage, crowds, fabric, shadows, and phone-camera grain\",\n\"MAIN_TEXT\": \"large hand-drawn caption or emotional headline\",\n\"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"small handwritten notes, repeated words, short joke, date-like label, or study annotation\",\n\"ACCENT_SYMBOL\": \"star, paw print, spiderweb, halo, abstract eye, plant, flower, underline, arrow, tally mark, or scribble\",\n\"WARDROBE_STYLE\": \"casual student streetwear, oversized shirt, hoodie, tote bag, loose trousers, jacket, headphones, sneakers, or art-school layers\",\n\"ASPECT_RATIO\": \"9:16 or 16:9\"\n},\n\"composition\": {\n\"layout_type\": \"candid phone snapshot with loud digital marker overlay\",\n\"base_photo\": \"realistic handheld image in a campus, gallery, studio, library, cafe, or night-city setting\",\n\"subject_position\": \"single subject or small group placed center or right, with doodles expanding around the silhouette\",\n\"doodle_anchor\": \"thick neon contour hugging the subject, with yellow-orange spikes, horns, rays, or fins radiating outward\",\n\"text_position\": \"large handwritten words in upper or side negative space; secondary notes scattered near corners or over dark background areas\",\n\"background_behavior\": \"specific real environment stays visible behind the marker layer\",\n\"cropping\": \"imperfect handheld crop, slight tilt, phone-camera framing, social snapshot feeling\"\n},\n\"photographic_direction\": {\n\"camera\": \"handheld phone-camera perspective, eye-level or slightly behind the subject, natural lens distortion\",\n\"lighting\": \"gallery spotlights, fluorescent classroom light, library lamps, cafe light, night-market glow, or mixed indoor shadows\",\n\"environment\": \"wall art, labels, shelves, posters, desks, signs, frames, books, display panels, crowds, bags, fabric, and shadows\",\n\"finish\": \"phone-photo grain, mild blur, JPEG compression, imperfect exposure, real low-light texture\",\n\"mood\": \"playful, distracted, funny, overstimulated, youthful, sarcastic, affectionate, and personal\"\n},\n\"illustration_rules\": {\n\"line_quality\": \"thick digital marker lines, wobbly black outlines, rough brush edges, casual pressure variation\",\n\"outline_system\": \"hot-pink primary silhouette outline with cyan offset line or glow\",\n\"spikes\": \"yellow-orange triangular monster spikes, horns, rays, fins, or sunburst forms around the subject\",\n\"symbols\": \"stars, paw prints, spiderweb corners, halos, abstract eyes, plants, flowers, hearts, tally marks, arrows, and scribble underlines\",\n\"integration\": \"doodles sit visibly on top of the photo and may cover objects, but the photo base remains recognizable\",\n\"texture\": \"digital marker, school notebook doodle, zine markup, rough social-story annotation\"\n},","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2933_out.png"]},{"i":4859,"text":"A premium beverage can placed in a realistic cinematic environment with splashing liquid, floating droplets, crushed ice, and glowing highlights, dramatic commercial lighting, ultra-detailed metallic texture, refreshing atmosphere, strong focus on the can, bold advertising composition, sharp realistic reflections, modern luxury beverage branding, high-end product photography style","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2932_out.png"]},{"i":4860,"text":"A high-end game character promo poster, vertical composition, ultra-close-up half-body special shot. The central figure is a stern, enigmatic young male fantasy character with fluffy silver-white tousled hair, strands fine and richly layered, topped with prominent white wolf ears or beast ears, exuding a cool, dangerous, restrained vibe. Only half his face is revealed, the other half obscured by a massive futuristic sniper rifle or heavy mechanical weapon, creating intense visual pressure. Just one eye shows, sharp, quiet, with a hunter's oppressive gaze.\n\nThe character wears a high-collared combat suit and light armor in deep blue, black, and metallic gold accents, premium materials blending leather, metal, mechanical armor structures, and faintly glowing energy components. The collar rises high to encase the neck, shoulders armored in rigid plates, the outfit heavy, austere, and precise in texture. The weapon looms close to the lens, dominating the right side of the frame in a vast sweep—designed as a futuristic sniper rifle with black-gold metal framework, intricate engravings, segmented mechanics, blue-glowing energy chambers or targeting modules, details intricate, fusing high-tech with Honor of Kings fantasy flair.\n\nBackground: A hazy, cool-toned fantasy battlefield or distant castle ruins, softly blurred, built from blue-grays, mist, faint glows, and far-off firelight for atmosphere. Air drifts with snowflakes, shattered ice, light motes, white particles, evoking cold, desolate, hushed stillness. Lighting from behind and upper side casts soft backlighting and rim light, illuminating edges of silver-white hair and weapon metal, adding depth to the figure. Overall palette: Cool blues, gray-whites, deep navy, metallic black, with hints of dark gold—cinematic vibe strong.\n\nOn the poster's left, integrate a large swath of Chinese calligraphy-style title text, strokes sharp and ink-splashed bold, deep blue ink texture; beside it, small vertical Roman letters and layout notes, forming a game character name poster design. Below, add slender fine-print slogan and English typesetting, styled like a top-tier MOBA mobile game's hero promo poster. Top can feature a subtle gold game brand mark or abstract emblem, bottom with centered series tagline layout.\n\nStyle Keywords: High-End Game Poster, Male Hero Character, Half-Face Obscured Composition, Ultra-Close-Up Special Shot, Silver-White Wolf-Ear Youth, Futuristic Sniper Rifle, Cool-Toned Cinematic Feel, Honor of Kings Style, Chinese Ink Title, Blue-Black-Gold Palette, Snow Particles, Fantasy Battlefield Backdrop, Refined Hair Strands, Piercing Gaze, High-Detail Materials, Premium Mobile Game Promo Visuals, Epic Scope, Oppressive Intensity, Cool, Mysterious, Ultra-HD Details.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2915_out.png"]},{"i":4861,"text":"Designer-grade modern poster layout with strong visual hierarchy, asymmetric composition, intentional imbalance, editorial rhythm, and luxury fashion magazine aesthetics. Avoid generic AI poster style, centered layouts, boring placement, floating elements, cheap event-poster feel, or template-based composition.\nUse a clear structure with hero zone, typography zone, breathing space, supporting detail area, and balanced graphic flow. Apply aggressive negative space, modular grid systems, layered visual rhythm, controlled chaos, cinematic cropping, and premium brand-level composition.\nTypography must feel like a design element — oversized headlines, ultra-small metadata, cropped text, vertical or rotated typography, overlapping layers, edge-aligned placement, broken grid layouts, and strong size contrast. Create tension, movement, and visual flow instead of clean predictable alignment.\nUse bold editorial cropping, unexpected framing, object overflow, and cinematic close-ups. Inspired by luxury fashion campaigns.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2904_out.png"]},{"i":4862,"text":"Travel Market Aesthetic\nCozy travel lifestyle photography of a stylish girl exploring a colorful street souvenir market, candid side profile pose while browsing handmade items and magnets, soft natural daylight, warm earthy tones, casual chic outfit with textured cream pants and pastel handbag, dreamy vacation atmosphere, handwritten doodle overlays surrounding the subject, white sketch outlines around the body, tiny hearts, stars, arrows and journal-style notes, scrapbook travel diary aesthetic, cinematic candid composition, soft film grain, Pinterest travel-core vibe, highly detailed realistic textures, relaxed “little moments” energy, ultra aesthetic street photography,8k.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2903_out.png"]},{"i":4863,"text":"Elara the Whisperer, serene ethereal woman with long flowing lavender hair and flower crown, soft compassionate smile, wearing delicate pastel gown, standing peacefully in enchanted forest with golden morning light, gentle glowing particles floating around her, soft wind moving her hair, Studio Ghibli style, ethereal fantasy, warm comforting atmosphere --ar 9:16 --stylize 750 --video","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2881_out.png"]},{"i":4864,"text":"Yor from SpyxFamily, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2878_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2878_in0.png"]},{"i":4865,"text":"Frieren from Frieren, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2866_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2866_in0.png"]},{"i":4866,"text":"Nobara Kugusaki from Jujutsu Kaisen, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2859_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2859_in0.png"]},{"i":4867,"text":"A high-end futuristic streetwear fashion poster featuring a faceless avant-garde model floating and leaping through the sky. The model wears an oversized beige puffer jacket with layered hoods and a knitted face mask completely covering the face. The lower outfit consists of loose white cargo pants layered with exaggerated light blue and dark blue stacked denim leg warmers, paired with beige sneakers and a black crossbody shoulder bag.\nThe composition uses an extreme low-angle perspective shot, making the legs and shoes appear dramatically enlarged for intense visual impact, as if the character is jumping directly over the viewer’s head. The pose feels anti-gravity and surreal — one arm stretched outward while one leg kicks forward dynamically, creating a floating airborne motion.\nThe background features a bright cyan-blue sky with soft white clouds, illuminated by clean sunlight and strong atmospheric depth. The overall visual style blends luxury fashion editorial photography, surreal streetwear advertising, and experimental urban poster design.\nAdd two smaller collage-style silhouette versions of the character in the top-right and bottom-left corners — one floating in the air and another mid-jump — creating the feeling of a fashion magazine collage layout.\nPoster layout should resemble a square luxury magazine cover adapted to a 9:16 vertical composition. Add massive abstract rounded typography at the top inspired by Y2K bubble fonts and experimental streetwear brand logos. Include a small graffiti-style brand mark on the left side. On the right side, place a white handwritten brush-style slogan reading: “RISE ABOVE WITH FASHION”, followed by tiny editorial-style caption text underneath. Add a small barcode centered at the bottom.\nThe design should include thin white borders and a soft off-white paper texture overlay.\nStyle keywords: futuristic street fashion, avant-garde clothing design, Y2K graphic design, magazine cover typography, collage silhouettes, extreme low-angle shot, sky background, surreal floating motion, exaggerated perspective, premium streetwear campaign, realistic fabric texture, ultra-detailed, clean luxury aesthetic.\nAspect ratio: 9:16 vertical.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2836_out.png"]},{"i":4868,"text":"Create a bold Y2K-inspired ripped paper collage poster with an edgy underground pop culture aesthetic.\n\n[MAIN SUBJECT]\nA stylish young Asian female model in a sensual yet fashion-editorial kneeling pose, positioned slightly off-center as if captured in a candid backstage moment. She is gracefully kneeling on one knee, torso subtly leaned forward, creating a strong S-curve silhouette. One hand gently touches her hair while the other rests near her thigh, conveying confidence and controlled attitude rather than explicit sexuality.\n\nShe has natural messy dark hair with loose strands across her face, glossy makeup, soft blush, and reflective metallic earrings. Her expression is expressive and slightly rebellious, with wide emotional eyes and a confident gaze directed slightly off-camera.\n\nHer outfit is a mix of casual denim layers and a vibrant statement fashion top, styled in a Y2K-inspired street editorial way. The pose feels spontaneous, cinematic, and emotionally charged, like a captured moment from an underground fashion shoot or magazine feature.\n\n[POSTER STYLE]\nThe entire composition should look like a handmade ripped magazine poster assembled from torn paper pieces and pasted layers.\n\nVisual style includes:\n- distressed paper textures\n- torn edges\n- photocopy grain\n- scratched film texture\n- wrinkled black paper background\n- tape overlays\n- zine / punk collage aesthetics\n- messy layered typography\n- underground concert flyer vibe\n- Y2K pop magazine energy\n\n[LAYOUT]\n- Large oversized headline typography filling the upper half\n- Main portrait centered vertically\n- Multiple floating text stickers scattered around the composition\n- Bright colored label blocks tilted at random angles\n- Bottom banner strip with huge typography\n- Small editorial code/date text near the bottom\n- Dynamic asymmetrical composition\n\n[TYPOGRAPHY ELEMENTS]\nInclude layered bold condensed typography with mixed sizes:\n- giant main title\n- small sticker-like labels\n- random short words\n- editorial tags\n- fragmented phrases\n\nTypography style:\n- distressed ink texture\n- imperfect print alignment\n- bold sans serif\n- high contrast black text\n- rough photocopied edges\n\n[COLOR PALETTE]\nMain colors:\n- deep black background\n- dirty white paper\n- neon green accents\n- vivid electric blue\n- bright warning red\n- subtle skin tones\n\n[GRAPHIC DETAILS]\nAdd:\n- ripped paper borders around subject\n- cracked mirror reflections\n- stars and doodle marks\n- marker scribbles\n- masking tape pieces\n- xerox texture\n- rough shadows between paper layers\n- sticker aesthetics\n- imperfect print noise\n\n[LIGHTING]\nHigh contrast editorial lighting with dramatic shadows and glossy highlights on skin. Flash photography feeling mixed with fashion magazine styling.\n\n[CAMERA]\nClose-up portrait framing, slightly cinematic fashion photography, shallow depth of field.\n\n[MOOD]\nRebellious, emotional, underground idol culture, chaotic pop aesthetic, nostalgic 2000s magazine energy, fashion zine atmosphere.\n\nUltra detailed, highly textured, layered collage composition, professional poster design, editorial quality, photorealistic subject, mixed media aesthetic, 4k.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2825_out.png"]},{"i":4869,"text":"Ultra-detailed infographic travel poster titled “FLAVORS OF INDIA”, elegant luxury editorial design, vertical composition, sophisticated culinary magazine aesthetic blended with modern 3D isometric cartography.\n\nAt the center: a highly detailed 3D isometric map of India in carved ivory-white stone texture, divided into states with subtle engraved borders. The map features miniature iconic Indian landmarks placed geographically: Taj Mahal, India Gate, Hawa Mahal, Charminar, Gateway of India, Meenakshi Temple, Kerala houseboats, Himalayan monasteries, and Varanasi ghats. Tiny rivers, palm trees, mountains, boats, and architectural miniatures integrated into the map for a premium handcrafted appearance.\n\nSurrounding the map: cinematic professional food photography of famous Indian dishes with luxury typography labels and elegant descriptions:\n\nButter Chicken\n\nHyderabadi Biryani\n\nMasala Dosa\n\nChole Bhature\n\nPani Puri\n\nGulab Jamun\n\nLassi\n\nRogan Josh\n\nPav Bhaji\n\nThali\n\nRight side vertical sidebar sections: “MUST TRY” and “ICONIC EXPERIENCES” containing small circular food icons and sepia architectural sketches with tiny editorial descriptions.\n\nBackground: warm off-white parchment paper texture with subtle grain, framed using delicate hand-drawn Indian botanical illustrations, lotus motifs, paisley patterns, spice illustrations, and fine golden ornamental borders.\n\nDecorative accents: floating spices (cardamom, cinnamon, saffron, chili, star anise), brass utensils, steam effects, tiny gold embellishments, compass rose, vintage travel map details.\n\nTypography style: luxury serif fonts, elegant gold embossed headings, refined editorial layout, premium spacing, Vogue magazine inspired composition.\n\nColor palette: warm saffron, ivory, deep maroon, gold, sandalwood beige, muted emerald, spice brown, soft terracotta.\n\nLighting: soft cinematic studio lighting, premium food-commercial photography lighting, subtle shadows, warm highlights.\n\nStyle keywords: ultra realistic, luxury infographic poster, gourmet travel editorial, cinematic food photography, 3D map illustration, handcrafted premium design, highly detailed textures, elegant tourism campaign, collectible poster aesthetic, 8K, masterpiece quality, global magazine cover quality, sophisticated composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2816_out.png"]},{"i":4870,"text":"Kaiser from Blue Lock (Manga series), rendered in an Asian manga-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2807_out.png"]},{"i":4871,"text":"Phoenix from VALORANT, rendered in an American-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2731_out.png"]},{"i":4872,"text":"Create a AAA-quality Unreal Engine 5 outfit selection screen for 【Artoria Pendragon from Fate/stay night.】\n\nThe visual style should be a high-quality realistic 3D game interface, making the character look like a fully playable in-game character. She should feature Unreal Engine 5-level detailed modeling, realistic skin texture, cinematic lighting, refined fabric materials, and a premium game UI design.\n\nAt the center of the page is the outfit selection interface, showcasing 4 completely different 【knight armor outfits】 for players to choose from.\nEach outfit should be paired with a different pose that highlights its unique strengths and visual appeal.\n\nThe page layout should be customized to match the character’s identity and personality, keeping the design rich and visually impressive while still clear and easy to read.\nShe should look like a realistic 3D game character, and the interface should include a prominent title area styled like a character name header.\nThe composition should be clean and well-structured, with a clear separation between the character and the UI elements, creating the feel of an authentic 3D game screenshot.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2726_out.png"]},{"i":4873,"text":"Ultra-detailed cinematic fantasy fashion magazine cover featuring {character_name} from {franchise}, reimagined as a divine haute couture icon while preserving their iconic silhouette, hairstyle, accessories, personality, powers, and signature motifs. The character stands in a majestic fantasy environment inspired by their universe — sacred temple, cosmic palace, futuristic cathedral, mythological sanctuary, or celestial throne hall.\nThey wear an elaborate luxury couture outfit inspired by their original design, combining flowing silk, translucent chiffon, intricate embroidery, metallic ornamentation, crystalline details, reflective materials, fantasy-tech elements, and symbolic motifs related to their lore and abilities.\nA gigantic mythical or energy-based construct surrounds them in a dynamic circular or spiral composition — celestial dragon, biomechanical entity, elemental serpent, sacred halo, divine relic, magical armor spirit, or cosmic energy manifestation — visually representing the character’s elemental affinity, combat style, and narrative symbolism.\nThe environment contains volumetric god rays, glowing particles, floating symbols, cinematic fog, reflective surfaces, layered architectural depth, magical energy trails, atmospheric bloom, and sacred cinematic lighting. Composition is symmetrical, centered, elegant, and designed like a premium luxury fashion editorial cover with large stylized typography elements that can be freely improvised by the AI.\nThe entire image MUST inherit the canonical color palette of the character, including lighting, energy effects, atmosphere, fabrics, reflections, particles, and environment.\nUltra realistic, cinematic fantasy, photorealistic, Unreal Engine 5, Octane Render, ray tracing, global illumination, HDR, volumetric lighting, depth of field, atmospheric perspective, masterpiece quality, ultra detailed, luxury editorial aesthetic, 8k.\nCamera: full body portrait, low angle shot, centered framing, symmetrical composition, 85mm lens look, shallow depth of field, cinematic perspective.\nNegative low quality, blurry, bad anatomy, extra limbs, poorly drawn hands, flat lighting, cheap costume, cluttered composition, oversaturated, low detail, cartoonish, text artifacts, watermark, cropped body, distorted face.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2722_out.png"]},{"i":4874,"text":"Ricoh GR3 Negative film, early 20s Chinese beautiful internet celebrity, naturally attractive and elegant, subtle sensuality without explicit exposure, soft confident gaze, gentle and slightly teasing smile long wavy black hair with soft bangs, natural movement, realistic skin texture with soft glow outfit: fitted crop top with moderate neckline (no excessive exposure) + high-waisted mini skirt, clean silhouette, emphasizing waistline and body proportion in a tasteful way, 1990s Japanese street fashion inspired pose: standing casually on an urban street, relaxed posture, slight body curve, one hand lightly touching hair or resting near waist, natural candid stance scene: quiet Japanese city street at golden hour, warm sunlight, soft shadows, everyday urban elements (vending machine, street signs, sidewalk textures), lived-in atmosphere lighting: warm golden hour light, soft highlight bloom, subtle rim light, slight overexposure in highlights style: 35mm analog film aesthetic, soft grain, warm vintage color tones, slight color fade, gentle light leaks, low contrast mood: nostalgic, intimate, candid, effortlessly attractive, “caught in a real moment” feeling camera: eye-level or slightly low angle, medium shot (waist-up or thigh-up), slight handheld feeling, shallow depth of field quality: ultra-realistic, fine details, cinematic texture, natural imperfections preserved aspect: 9:16","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2702_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2702_in0.png"]},{"i":4875,"text":"Create a wide, horizontal character reference sheet featuring female robin from fire emblem in a black loose cutoff tank top and black gym shorts that are exposed and her open black tactician cloak around her shoulders. The background should be white grid paper.\n\nThe page should include multiple angles of the same character:\n\nA front close-up\nA confident standing front pose (one hand on hip)\nA back-facing standing pose\nA stretching pose with hands behind the head (low-angle rear-side view)\nA smirking pose, ready to strike (front view)\nA blushing pose, flustered and pouting with a look to the side (front side view)\n\nThe layout should be customized to fit the character’s personality—visually rich yet clean and easy to read. You may include handwritten-style annotations, small arrows, and a prominent title area styled like a character name header","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2700_out.png"]},{"i":4876,"text":"Isshin from Bleach, rendered in an Kubo tite-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2662_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2662_in0.png"]},{"i":4877,"text":"A Korean woman in her 20s posing in a polished school-inspired blazer outfit, calm confident expression with slightly lowered chin and direct blue-eyed gaze, long blonde wavy hair tied loosely with a dark ribbon, wearing a navy tailored blazer with gold trim, crisp white blouse, red ribbon tie, gray pleated skirt, and subtle jewelry, ultra-photorealistic studio fashion portrait, clean white seamless background, bright indoor studio light, vertical upper-body framing from above the waist, slightly elevated viewpoint looking down to emphasize her composed posture, centered symmetrical composition with shoulders squared and hands held behind her back, clear softbox lighting with delicate catchlights, navy, white, gray, red, and gold palette, refined elite academy mood while clearly adult, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, realistic blazer weave, polished buttons, smooth hair strands, clean skin texture, precise high-fashion detail.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2660_out.png"]},{"i":4878,"text":"请根据用户输入的【主题】或上传的【参考图片】，创作一张横向 4:3 的高完成度「AI美甲灵感方案 」。\n\n【输入规则】\n如果用户提供的是文字主题，请根据主题进行抽象提炼。\n如果用户提供的是参考图片：\n- Image A 是灵感参考图，是本次美甲方案的核心灵感来源；\n- 如果用户还提供了手部照片，则 Image B 为手部参考图，用于辅助生成更贴近肤色与手型的实际上手效果；\n- 如果没有手部照片，请生成一组自然、真实、审美在线的通用女性双手上手效果图。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n【图片标题与副标题】\n主标题请明确写：\nAI美甲灵感方案\n\n英文副标题可写：\nAI Nail Inspiration Board\n\n小标题可根据主题自动生成，例如：\nInspired by [主题名称]\n或\nVisual Translation of [主题名称]\n\n如果是中文主题，也可以中英结合，例如：\n灵感来源 / Inspired by [主题]\n主题转译 / Concept Translation\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n【整体版式要求】\n横向 4:3 版式，整体采用高端提案板排版。\n\n画面建议分为以下几个模块，并保持层次清晰、留白舒服、结构有秩序：\n\n一、顶部标题区\n二、灵感来源区\n三、视觉元素提取区\n四、10指甲设计区（核心主视觉）\n五、风格总结区\n六、推荐甲型 / 工艺 / 场景区\n七、实际上手效果区（非常重要）\n八、底部总结区\n\n背景保持干净克制，可使用暖白、奶油白、浅灰、浅米色、雾粉灰等高级底色，不要过度花哨。\n整体设计感应偏向高端美甲品牌视觉、时尚杂志内页、设计提案板，而不是电商详情页或低质海报。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n【各板块详细要求】\n\n① 标题区 / Title Area\n在画面上方清晰呈现：\n- 主标题：AI美甲灵感方案\n- 英文副标题：AI Nail Inspiration Board\n- 主题名称：根据用户输入自动生成\n- 一句简洁的风格描述，例如：\n“从主题中提取色彩、符号与情绪，转译为一整套可上手的美甲方案。”\n\n标题区要简洁有力，体现高级感和设计感。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n② 灵感来源区 / Inspiration Source\n如果用户上传了参考图，请在左上或上方区域展示参考图缩略图，并标注：\n- 灵感来源 / Inspiration Source\n- 主题名称\n- 简短说明：这次设计从参考图中提取了哪些气质与方向\n\n如果用户只输入文字主题，则在此区域以文字方式呈现：\n- 主题名称\n- 主题简介\n- 核心氛围描述\n\n此区不是大篇文字，而是简洁专业、像设计说明一样。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n③ 视觉元素提取区 / Visual Extraction\n请将灵感拆解成几个清晰的小模块，排版精致、信息明确：\n\nA. 色彩系统 / Color Palette\n请推荐：\n- 主色 3 个\n- 辅助色 2 个\n- 点缀色 1 个\n\n用小色卡形式展示，并标注色彩名称。\n色彩命名可偏审美化，例如：\n奶杏裸粉、冷调银灰、酒红莓果、墨绿、雾霾紫、香槟金、深海蓝、珍珠白等。\n\nB. 关键词 / Style Keywords\n提炼 4—6 个关键词，例如：\n温柔、神秘、复古、冷艳、梦幻、浪漫、华丽、克制、轻甜、未来感、松弛、清冷、戏剧感等。\n\nC. 图案与符号 / Motifs\n提取 4—6 个可被转译进甲面的视觉元素，例如：\n月亮、星轨、花瓣、水波、羽毛、火焰、丝带、蝴蝶、格纹、书页、音符、金线、藤蔓、金属边框、玻璃碎片感等。\n\nD. 材质与工艺 / Texture & Finish\n提炼适合本次主题的工艺方向，例如：\n猫眼、珠光、金箔、渐变晕染、镜面、果冻透感、法式边、贝壳碎片、磨砂、立体水滴、微浮雕、细闪、丝绒感等。\n\n这一整区要非常像“设计逻辑提取板”，清晰、专业、简洁。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n④ 10指甲设计区 / 10-Nail Design Plan\n这是整张图的绝对核心，请占据最大视觉权重。\n\n请明确展示：\n- 左手 5 枚\n- 右手 5 枚\n\n每一个指甲都要单独清晰呈现，并附简洁说明。\n建议每枚指甲包含：\n- 指位（Thumb / Index / Middle / Ring / Pinky）\n- 设计名称\n- 简短说明（1句话）\n- 主要元素 / 工艺\n\n整套 10 指甲必须形成统一风格，同时又有节奏变化，不可十个都一样，也不可毫无联系地乱做。\n既要有完整系列感，又要有细节差异和层次感。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n⑤ 风格总结区 / Concept Summary\n请在右侧或中右区域做一个小型总结模块，包含：\n\n- 风格主题 / Style Theme\n例如：\n暗夜玫瑰 / Midnight Rose\n海风日落 / Sunset Coast\n旧梦电影感 / Retro Cinema Mood\n春日书页 / Spring Pages\n深海星轨 / Ocean Starline\n\n- 整体气质说明\n用 1 段简洁说明总结整套方案的方向，例如：\n“这套设计通过低饱和主色、细节金属线条与局部珠光工艺，将灵感中的浪漫与克制感转译为更适合日常佩戴的高级美甲方案。”\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n⑥ 甲型 / 工艺 / 适用场景区\n请做成小而精致的模块，包含：\n\nA. 推荐甲型 / Nail Shape\n根据主题与风格自动推荐 1—2 种合适甲型，例如：\n- 短圆甲\n- 方圆甲\n- 椭圆甲\n- 杏仁甲\n- 中长椭圆甲\n\n并简短说明理由，如：\n“更显精致”“更适合日常佩戴”“更能承载图案层次”“更显手部修长感”。\n\nB. 推荐工艺 / Recommended Finishes\n总结这套设计最重要的工艺重点，例如：\n渐变晕染、微珠光、金线细节、猫眼流光、局部镜面等。\n\nC. 场景建议 / Best For\n说明适合的场景，例如：\n通勤、约会、婚礼、度假、节日、演唱会、春夏、秋冬等。\n\n这一块要像“实用落地建议”，增强方案可执行性。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n⑦ 实际上手效果区 / On-Hand Preview\n这一部分非常重要，必须精致、真实、有说服力。\n\n请生成一组高完成度的双手上手效果图，展示这整套美甲真正做在手上的样子。\n要求：\n- 双手自然、真实、比例正常\n- 手部姿态优雅，不夸张、不僵硬\n- 指甲细节清晰可见\n- 光线柔和高级，具有棚拍质感\n- 可采用自然摆拍方式\n\n如果用户提供了手部照片，请尽量匹配其手部肤色与基础手型特征；\n如果没有手部照片，请生成一组大众审美友好、气质自然、适合展示美甲的女性双手效果。\n\n重点：\n这不是简单的小缩略图，而是整张图中非常关键的落地展示模块。\n要让用户第一眼就觉得：“这套设计真的能做，而且做出来会很好看。”\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n⑧ 底部总结区 / Final Note\n请在底部或右下角写一句清晰有力的总结语，例如：\n\n“这套方案并非简单复制灵感来源，而是提取其色彩、情绪与符号语言，转译为更适合甲面表达、同时兼顾美感与佩戴性的完整美甲设计。”\n\n这句总结要起到“收尾 + 提升专业感”的作用。\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\n最终请输出一张横向 4:3 的高完成度「AI美甲灵感方案」专业提案图。\n用户第一眼应被这套美甲方案吸引，第二眼能看懂整套设计逻辑，第三眼会觉得这套方案真实可做、而且做出来会很好看。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2643_out.png"]},{"i":4879,"text":"Vi from Arcane, rendered in an American-style thick paint illustration. Side-profile, half-body close-up with the character faithfully matching the original design, gaze directed to the left. Minimalist beige background with extensive negative space, composition weighted to the right. Clean, premium aesthetic with soft, cinematic lighting, rim light, high contrast but low saturation color palette, with subtle accent colors reflecting the character’s main tones. Geometric, faceted painting style with detailed skin texture and hair strands. Commercial poster layout with bold headline typography design. Vertical 9:16 format.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/2615_out.png"]}];